{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30387","headline":"越中寺居寄上主人 · 赵嘏","name":"越中寺居寄上主人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野寺初容访静来，晚晴江上见楼台。\n中林有路到花尽，一日无人看竹回。\n自晒诗书经雨後，别留门户爲僧开。\n苦心若是酬恩事，不敢吟春忆酒杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30387.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30387","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}